(MERIDIAN MARITIME - CONDUCT, GRIEVANCE AND BUSINESS TRAVEL) Tj T*
(Policy HR-310, effective 1 January 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Code of conduct) Tj T*
(Meridian Maritime has zero tolerance for harassment, bullying and discrimination. Gifts or) Tj T*
(hospitality with a value above 50 USD from suppliers or customers must be declared to the) Tj T*
(Compliance Officer. Any conflict of interest must be disclosed to the line manager within 14) Tj T*
(days of the employee becoming aware of it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Raising a grievance) Tj T*
(Step 1: the employee should first try to resolve the matter informally with their line) Tj T*
(manager within 10 working days of the incident.) Tj T*
(Step 2: if unresolved, the employee submits a written complaint to HR within 15 working days) Tj T*
(of the incident. HR acknowledges the complaint within 2 working days and completes an) Tj T*
(investigation within 20 working days.) Tj T*
(Step 3: the employee may appeal the outcome to the Director within 7 days of receiving it.) Tj T*
(The Director's decision is final.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Disciplinary process) Tj T*
(Disciplinary action follows four stages: a verbal warning, a written warning, a final) Tj T*
(written warning and dismissal. A written warning remains valid for 12 months and a final) Tj T*
(written warning for 18 months. Gross misconduct, such as theft or violence, may lead) Tj T*
(directly to dismissal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Whistleblowing) Tj T*
(Concerns about fraud, safety or serious misconduct can be reported confidentially to) Tj T*
(ethics@meridianmaritime.example or to the anonymous ethics line on 0800 555 0142.) Tj T*
(Retaliation against someone who reports in good faith is a disciplinary offence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Business travel) Tj T*
(Flights shorter than 6 hours are booked in economy class; flights of 6 hours or longer may) Tj T*
(be booked in premium economy. The maximum hotel rate is 140 USD per night. The daily meal) Tj T*
(allowance is 45 USD. Employees must submit expense claims with receipts within 14 days of) Tj T*
(returning from travel. Claims submitted later than 14 days are not reimbursed unless the) Tj T*
(Finance Director approves an exception.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Use of company equipment) Tj T*
(Company laptops and phones may be used for limited personal purposes. Employees must not) Tj T*
(install unlicensed software. Lost or stolen equipment must be reported to IT within 24) Tj T*
(hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
